{"speciesId":558,"names":{"fr":"Crabaraque","es":"Crustle","en":"Crustle","ja":"イワパレス"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Entre eux, les querelles de territoire sont fréquentes et violentes. Celui qui se fait briser son rocher a perdu."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Competing for territory, Crustle fight viciously. The one whose boulder is broken is the loser of the battle."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il est assez endurant pour voyager des jours durant dans des zones desséchées avec son lourd rocher sur le dos."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It possesses legs of enormous strength, enabling it to carry heavy slabs for many days, even when crossing arid land."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"When its boulder is broken in battles for territory, it feels unsure and begins to weaken."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"When its boulder is broken in battles for territory, it feels unsure and begins to weaken."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il est assez endurant pour voyager des jours durant dans des zones desséchées avec son lourd rocher sur le dos."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Su inmensa capacidad motriz le permite desplazarse cargando a sus espaldas rocas enormes durante días."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It possesses legs of enormous strength, enabling it to carry heavy slabs for many days, even when crossing arid land."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"重たい 岩を 背負って 乾燥した 土地を 何日でも 移動できる 脚力を 持つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Entre eux, les querelles de territoire sont fréquentes et violentes. Celui qui se fait briser son rocher a perdu."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Se disputa el territorio con sus congéneres. Pierde aquel al que le rompan la roca que lleva a cuestas."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Competing for territory, Crustle fight viciously. The one whose boulder is broken is the loser of the battle."